  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GiveTheKidsABath.LeadsYouToBathroom": "[say: Right, come with me.] She leads you to the bathroom. Urta spared no expense in making this place as luxuriant as possible - you could easily fit the core of your campsite in here. A huge marble bathtub, sunken into the floor itself, dominates the room, big enough that two or three centaurs could easily fit into it. Shiny brass taps stand ready to fill the sizable bath, which is already gently steaming from a brimming load of hot water already prepared."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GiveTheKidsABath.LiannaBringsClothes": "[pg]{0} Lianna arrives, carrying the folded clothes and naked... very naked. She sits beside you and gently asks, [say: How's it going? {1} didn't try to splash you, did {2}?] Just as she finishes posing the question, your "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GiveTheKidsABath.LiannaCollectsClothes": "[pg]Lianna busies herself by collecting the discarded clothing. [say: I'll go pick up fresh clothes, you go ahead and get started, [name].] You nod to her, and then, taking up the nearest bottle of shampoo, you start approaching the bathtub. A splash of water promptly slaps you wetly across the face, and you shake it dry. A scolding subdues your rambunctious offspring, and no further splashes greet you until you are kneeling besides the tub. You reach for the "
