  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GiveTheKidsABath.LiannaPointsToBottles": "[pg]Lianna points to a stack of bottles and lotions. [say: The shampoo and soaps are over there, I trust you know what to do with those?] You tell the skunkette that you do. [saystart]Very well, I'll go get "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GiveTheKidsABath.MutterThenPerkUp": " mutter{0} rebelliously, but then perk{1} up at the sight of you. Immediately {2} start{3} pulling off {4} clothes and then, naked as the day {5} born, swarm{6} you, hugging you tightly. You dole out comforting pats and playful strokes, then instruct {7} to get into the tub. Mournful eyes look at you, but, seeing you won't be swayed, {8} with a splash into the bathtub. Once in the water, {9} start{10} to enjoy {11}, merrily kicking and splashing about in what is, for {12}, a decent-sized pool. This gives you an opportunity to note the sex of your little rugrat{13}."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GiveTheKidsABath.NearestWord": "nearest "
