  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoAfterUrtaBirf.ApologizeMakeItUp": "You apologize, but there are pressing matters you need to attend to today... but you'll make it up to her somehow, you promise. Urta looks disappointed, but sighs sadly and nods her head. [say: Of course. You're still a busy adventurer and all that. Well, don't worry; I'll make sure this little one gets home and settled in safely.]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoHomeHorsecock.DressAndAskFarewell": "You nod at Urta and gather your clothes, redressing in an instant. Before going you ask if Urta needs anything. She smiles and shakes her head, a soft smile on her face. You bid her a good rest and leave her apartment."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.BeautifulBabySayEnd": " really here; our beautiful, beautiful little baby...[sayend] She sobs, "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.BeenBusyIndeed": "[pg][say: Hello again, [name]. I see you two have been busy.] He glances knowingly at you and Urta. All you can do is smile sheepishly and hug Urta. The vixen looks a little embarrassed, but doesn't bother to hide her pride."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.BlushingKissPull": "[pg]Urta blushes with embarrassment, then promptly wraps her arms around your neck and pulls you into a kiss. She happily makes out with you for several moments, then lets out a yelp as a distinctly unusual moisture floods her gown's crotch. [say: Oh... I think my water just broke.] She tells you and the doctor."
