  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.ClinicTripBlur": "The trip to the clinic where Urta is giving birth to your child is a blur; all that matters is getting there as fast as possible. The centaur abandons you at the hospital doors, and you make your own way inside, approaching the counter inside.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.ContractionsEveryTen": "[pg][say: Oh, yes.] Urta agrees. [say: At least one every five to ten minutes or so.] She explains."
