  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.InhaleExhalePush": "[pg]Rhythmically, Urta inhales and exhales, pushing when told to push and then pausing to gather her strength, huffing and moaning as her child rapidly slides around inside of her, moving inexorably to freedom via the gash under her balls."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.KnowingCoyGrin": "[pg]You look at Urta knowingly, already anticipating what comes next. Urta gives you a coy grin, looking up at you from hooded eyes. [say: Well, I hardly think you need me to tell you where the three of us go from here... if you have the time, that is?]"
