  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.MoansWithContraction": "[pg]She moans softly as she kisses you back, squeezing your hand, flexing it a little harder as her contractions wrack her. She clearly wasn't kidding around when she said they actually felt kind of good; you can see her gown starting to tent out of the corner of your eye."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.NormalFoxSayEnd": "he's a perfectly normal little fox,[sayend] the doctor notes, and you can catch a quick glimpse of a somewhat bigger than normal vulpine sheathe on your "
