  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.SeeTheHeadPush": "[pg][say: I can see the head! Remember: push, breathe, push, breath, keep your pace.] Urta moans loudly, though not exactly in a pained manner, holds onto her knees and visibly strains. Her belly suddenly flattens and an infantile wail splits the air; the birth is complete."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.SeesYourGaze": "[pg]She sees where you're looking and manages to giggle. [say: Yep, we're going to be holding our little one soon.] She winces, belly visibly shaking as her muscles flex in a contraction. [say: Very soon, I hope... though, to be honest, there's not really all that much pain. It actually feels kinda good.]"
