  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.SoftKnockingAtDoor": "[pg]A soft knocking comes from the door. Urta breaks her lip lock with you with a slightly embarrassed giggle. [say: Come in, please.] She calls out. The door opens to reveal a turtle-man wearing a white coat. He adjusts his purple necktie before saying, [say: Good Evening. My name is Doctor Donatello, and I'll be overseeing your delivery today.] He smiles."
