  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.SonWordAgain": "son"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.SplinterBowsLeaves": "[pg][say: The doctor will be with you soon,] Splinter bows and leaves, closing the door behind her. You walk towards Urta and gently pat her belly, feeling the baby kicking inside, then smile at her. As you do, you lean in to kiss her and hold her hand."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.SplinterGrinsGreeting": "Splinter grins when she sees you. [say: Back again, are we? Here for Urta? Wow, you two seem to really like popping them out - who'd of thought that the captain of the Watch wanted to be a baby-maker, huh? Hmm... you know, I've been feeling a little broody myself...] She laughs at your response. [say: Just kidding; come on then, stud; Urta is this way.] She sets off on the now-familiar route."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.StethoscopeAway": "[pg][say: Yes, they'll be coming anytime now...] He puts his stethoscope away and looks at the both of you, then smiles. [say: Don't mind me, feel free to make out with your wife, it actually helps the process. Plus it's always a delight seeing such a nice couple as the two of you expecting.]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.StrangeNameDonatello": "[pg]Donatello? That's a strange name... Noticing your thoughtful look, the doctor quickly puts the pieces together. [say: Weird name, no? If you prefer you may just call me Dr. Don.] He extends a hand and you quickly introduce yourself, accepting the handshake. He moves away."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.TurtleDoctorPosition": "[pg]The turtle doctor quickly gets into position helping Urta hold her legs up; he instructs the both of you on how to proceed and you do your best to support Urta throughout the ordeal."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.UmbilicalCordWrap": "[pg]Dr. Don makes quick work of the umbilical cord and wraps the baby in a towel. [saystart]Congratulations, [name] and Urta! You two have given birth to a healthy "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.UrtaOnBedGowned": "[pg]As soon as you enter Urta's room, you spot the vixen lying on her back in a bed, naked save for a gown. You greet her and ogle her bulging belly."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.GoVisitUrtaBirfs.UrtaReassuresYou": "[pg][say: He's a very good doctor, [name],] Urta interjects as if to reassure you. [say: He handles a lot of Watch-related treatments... he, uh, sort of specializes in this particular predicament,] she grins sheepishly, patting her belly."
