  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.LastBitOfCone": " There's just a bit of cone left as you return to Urta's house, and you quickly polish that off, upon entering. [say: Oh, hey. You're back.] Lianna greets you in her usual inexpressive fashion."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.LiannaNotToTrifle": " that Lianna is not one to be trifled with and so {0} march"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.LickingMeltingDroplets": " along with your own, greedily licking up melting droplets. "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.MarketAsDestination": ". Well, the vendors down at the market would make for a suitably far destination, which should give Lianna plenty of time for herself, and you yourself wouldn't mind some ice cream either at that, so it's decided. [say: Yay! You're the best [dad] ever!] "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.MeanderingPathToMarket": "[pg]You take a meandering path to the markets, making sure you keep a vigilant eye on your curious offspring lest {0} run off and get {1}sel{2} into too much trouble. Some of the denizens who recognize you, if only as Urta's mate, give you their regards."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.OffToBathroomNote": " off to the bathroom. You can't help but note how good Lianna is at making kids do what she says."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.OfferToTakeThem": "[pg]You suggest that you could take {0} for a walk instead. [say: You sure? {1} can be a handful sometimes... though yours usually behave{2}.] You insist you'd like to do so; {3} might enjoy having you along anyway. [say: Fine, I'll just get {4} ready and you can be on your way.]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.ParaYourChildPrefix": "[pg]Your child"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.PleadsWord": " pleads"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.ProduceAndTrinketStalls": " various produce, clothing and trinket stalls. {0} what {1} here for, however and {2} give you much of a chance to browse before a {3} and drags you off in the direction of the ice cream shop tucked away in a sheltered and cool part of the bazaar. Once you're inside, you take a look around as your child"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.RenPleadPrefix": "ren plead"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.RenWord": "ren"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.RenWordAgain": "ren"
