  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.RenWordFourth": "ren"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.RenWordThird": "ren"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.ReplyWithoutHitch": "[pg]Without a hitch, you reply. The {0} of you stopped for some ice cream along the way. [say: Good, now off you go. Bathtime,] she states, ushering your little fox"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.RunWord": " run"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.RunsOffToInspect": "{0} runs off to curiously inspect"
