  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.SingleExcitedCheer": "an excited cheer sounds out."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.SkipSavoringIceCream": " don't bother waiting or savoring their ice cream and neither do you, it's damned hot walking around this desert. There's less cause for mischief too, {0} face"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.SkunkHeadsToBath": "[pg]Given that the skunk is heading up to the bath herself, you decide to show yourself out and quietly leave."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.StaringUpAtYou": " staring up at you."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.StateFreshAirWalk": "[pg][say: I'm just taking {0} for a walk. Kids need fresh air sometimes, too,] Lianna states matter-of-factly, exiting the kitchen and heading off to the backyard."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.TallLankyWolf": "[pg]He's a tall, lanky wolf-morph, {0} a dusty white and eyes of a clear light blue and he's wearing a robe with various snowflakes embroidered on it. [say: I'd recognize {1} anywhere! This must be Urta's lot?] he asks you and you reply in the affirmative. [say: Well now consider this on the house, it's the least I can do after all the good Captain has done for us!] What a spot of luck! You and your child"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.UpAndPressPrefix": " up and press"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TakeTheKidsForWalk.YourChildPrefix": " Your child"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiana.AlchemistUnderRoof": "[pg]You explain to Urta that the would-be alchemist living under her roof has told you that she wants to take \"samples\" of your sexual fluids for her experiments."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiana.BabysitterSearchQuestion": "[pg]You ask Urta how exactly she found Lianna as a potential babysitter. Come to think of it, where did she find her?"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiana.ChildrenHaveSuffix": "ren have"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiana.ConcernsWavedAway": "[pg]Urta waves your concerns away. [say: Don't worry about that, [name]. I had a chat with Lianna before you visited and she asked for permission before approaching for help on her tests.] She smiles deviously at you. [say: Unless... you're not going to her for anything other than helping her in said experiments, are you?] You tell her that you aren't. [say: Good... because if you cross the line, I might just have to punish you.] She taps you on the nose."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiana.HasVerbWord": " has"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiana.InsecuritiesButTrust": "[pg]Whatever insecurities you may still have, Urta clearly trusts her. You decide it's best to tell her that you'll try and trust Urta's judgment on this matter; dealing with people like Lianna is more her job than yours, after all."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiana.LianaExperimentConfession": "[pg]You confess to Urta that you allowed yourself to be tempted into helping Lianna with some private experiments... experiments that required her taking samples of your sexual fluids."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiana.PermissionGrantedSmile": "[pg]Urta smiles at hearing that. [say: Go ahead then, I won't be mad if you help her.] You ask why that is the case. [say: I had a chat with her before you two met, and she's taken some interest in you, so I said it was okay if she asked for your help.] She's taking the idea quite well, you note. [say: Just remember that you're only <b>helping</b> with her experiments. So unless you cross the boundaries on that one, I'm okay with it.] She looks you over suspiciously. [say: You're not thinking of taking this any further than that are you?] Deciding it wouldn't be smart to give any answer other than no, you tell her that you aren't. [say: Good.] She nods assertively."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiana.PuzzledVixenResponds": "[pg][say: Yes, [name]?] The politely puzzled prick-vixen responds."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiana.SeriousTalkRequest": "You tell Urta that you need to talk with her about something."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiana.SpecialPlaceInHeart": " a special place in her heart.[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiana.SubordinatesScoutedAds": "[pg][say: I had a few of my subordinates distribute ads and scout for anyone interested. With you living out of town and me being the Watch Captain and all, I really needed someone to live in-house. Just in case anything happens.] She nods, smiling triumphantly. [say: I got a few contacts from people interested and set up some interviews, Lianna was the best of the bunch.] Then she adds. [say: Plus she was cute too.] You can't resist noting that it figures that would play a role in this. "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiana.TrustQuestionDoubt": "[pg]Then you ask if Urta's really so willing to trust her children's safety to Lianna. Something about her doesn't feel right - those experiments she wants to do give you a sinister vibe... [saystart]To be honest... sometimes I get the same vibe from her, lover. But trust me, I checked her background twice over, and aside from a few mishaps, she's never produced anything that could harm another person, plus she was tutored by a renowned alchemist. And while it may be hard for you to notice, it's clear to me that our child"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiana.WinkAndKiss": "[pg][say: Thanks, lover. I'm sure you'll see that I didn't choose her for the wrong reasons, plus I'll be keeping a close eye on her.] She winks at you. [say: Now if you'll excuse me, I think I'll go check up on her, see you later?] Urta kisses you goodbye and leaves the bar. You watch her go, order yourself a drink for the road, and set off yourself."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiannasLubeSpray.AskSelfExperiments": "[pg]She's been experimenting on her body? Doesn't that seem kind of reckless, you ask her."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiannasLubeSpray.AskWhyLubricant": "You ask why it is that she produces a lubricating liquid rather than a noxious one, like you would expect of a skunk."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiannasLubeSpray.ClearsThroatConfession": "[pg][say: Oh? Sorry.] She clears her throat and adjusts her eyes. [say: I had a lot of trouble controlling my spraying reflexes, which wound up leaving me in very embarrassing situations. So I tried to control my reflexes with the aid of alchemy, and while it worked for the most part, it wound up completely neutralizing my odor inducing hormones. So all I was left with is this slick looking liquid.] She reaches inside her pants, behind her butt and removes a pair of slick-looking digits, displaying the viscous liquid for you. [say: It works great as lube, and I'm not too sad about losing my smelly spray either. It's not like I'll ever need it.] She shrugs. [say: I've tried analysing my spray, and came to the conclusion that if distilled, it may have some magical properties... probably a side-effect of me messing with my body, but it's only effective if you have a very high concentration of it.]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiannasLubeSpray.EmbarrassedAvertedEyes": "[pg]She averts her eyes in embarrassment, red visible{0} on her cheeks. [say: Well, I had a few problems regarding my spray...] She stops talking. You verbally nudge her, asking her to continue the story."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiannasLubeSpray.ExplanationDonePrompt": "[pg]Finished with her explanation, she adjusts her glasses and asks, [say: Something else?]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiannasLubeSpray.FoolishButNoLecture": "[pg]That still seems a bit foolish, but you decide it's not your place to lecture."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkAboutLiannasLubeSpray.ShrugNoTestSubjects": "[pg]She shrugs. [say: Maybe, but it's not like I have anyone else to test my experiments on. I do suffer from some side-effects due to my experiments, but it's all good... I think.]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLiana.AskToTalkHer": "You tell her you'd like to talk her. She adjusts her glasses. [say: Oh? What about?]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerJob.AlchemyAmbition": "[pg][say: Now about the future... I've always been fascinated by alchemy. I believe I have a talent, and so this is what I want to do. Just that.] She shrugs. You spare a moment to wonder why so many people in this world seem fascinated by magical and chemical weirdness, even despite what the demons are doing with that very thing, but consider it's not important to ask any further."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerJob.AskAboutJobs": "You ask her about her jobs, both for Urta and what she intends to do afterwards."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerJob.AskSomethingElse": "[pg][say: Something else?]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerJob.UrtaJobGodsend": "[pg]She takes a deep breath. [say: Well, working for Urta was a godsend, really. I have a place to live, food, the job is relatively easy, and I can continue to study alchemy in my room. Plus Urta is nice, she treats me well.] You note that she seems genuine, and indicate for her to continue."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.AllHumansMate": "[pg][say: And this is not just about you either, this is the case with every human that mates with one of us Marethians. Usually the human parent only passes on a few genes, like hair color, or eye color, but actual species? That will be the Marethian parent's species, always.]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.AskMotherCloseness": "[pg]You ask if she was close to her mother, then, to make her wonder so much about her race."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.AskResearchFruit": "[pg]Nodding your head absently at the thought, you ask if her efforts have borne any fruit yet."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.AskWhatPushedHer": "and ask if that's what pushed her to studying humans and Marethians."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.AskWhySamples": "You ask her why she's so eager to get samples from you, a human. What sort of research is she doing that she needs human samples?"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.EyesLightUpInterest": "[pg]Her eyes light up; obviously this is a subject of interest for her. [say: I suppose the main reason I'm conducting this research is curiosity. I guess I thought about it while looking at your kids. I mean... we usually get hybrids when we mate with other species, but couplings with a human? They always result in the children being the father or mother's species. I want to know: why is that? Why don't we get human-fox hybrids?] She adjusts her glasses."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.GenuineCuriosityShrug": "[pg]She shrugs. [say: I guess, though what I have is genuine curiosity. Maybe someday one of your kids will ask why they don't look like [daddy]. Wouldn't you want to have an answer to that question?] She smiles."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.GiggleHumanMother": "[pg]She giggles, [say: I should have you know that my mother was also a human. My father said she stumbled upon his house years ago, before we moved to Tel'Adre. He says I have the same eyes my mother had.] She smiles sadly. [say: I want to know why I'm not half-human, and instead I'm 100% skunk; for that end, I need samples from human semen and ovum.]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.HalfheartedSympathy": "however half-heartedly it may be, "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.MotherDiedYoung": "[pg]She shakes her head. [say: My mother passed away when I was just a little girl. Apparently she caught a foreign illness and didn't make it.] You offer her an apology, "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.NoSamplesAppeal": "[pg]She shrugs. [say: Sadly, I don't have any samples to work with, which is why I asked for your help. So if you feel like helping me, just tell me. And don't worry, I'll help extract your samples. I'd like to think I'm pretty skilled at... extracting... samples.] She smiles confidently."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.PromiseBestEffort": "[pg]You tell her that you'll try your best."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.SighNoProgress": "[pg]She sighs. [say: So far, nothing. Though your help does take at least one step closer to finding out why that is so. I hope I can count on your continued support?]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.StillConsidering": "[pg]You're still thinking it over, but you'll be sure to think it over, you tell her."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToLianaAboutHerResearch.ThanksAskMore": "[pg][say: Thanks. Now, is there something else?]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToUrtaAboutHerHouse.CaptainPaycheck": "[pg]She chuckles, [say: No, no, don't worry about that. I'm the captain of the Watch, after all. My paycheck is nothing to sneeze at. Throw in my nest egg and the recent bonus to my pay, and... well, let's just say that money isn't on my list of immediate concerns.] She then gives you a mock-offended look, [say: What? Did you think I boozed my way from paycheck to paycheck before I met you? My old place was a mess because, frankly, I didn't care enough to do anything more - it gave me privacy and a place to sleep, that was all I needed. I didn't have someone in my life to make me believe my life really mattered back then... not like now.] She concludes, giving you a soft smile. [say: So, that answer your questions?]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToUrtaAboutHerHouse.ChildPipesUp": "pipes up asking what we're doing.[sayend] She shakes her head with amused smirk. [say: No, I'd rather keep the old place for our little love nest; we can have our fun there, then come home and be all respectable around the kids.]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToUrtaAboutHerHouse.EmotionalValueAside": " despite it having some emotional value to you."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToUrtaAboutHerHouse.FootRubbingHint": "[pg][say: Now, since we've been talking about my apartment...] Urta begins, rubbing one foot against yours, [say: how about we duck back there and give the bed a run? For old time's sake?] She smirks, even as her cock hits the table with an audible *THUNK*."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToUrtaAboutHerHouse.MonsterRunningAround": "[pg][say: Do you really want to try to have sex with our little monster running around?] Urta chuckles. [saystart]I know we grow faster than humans do, especially in my case, but I'd rather not have to explain the harpies and the beegirls just yet. Besides, I can't think of a worse mood-killer than to be right in the middle of our stroke when a little voice "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToUrtaAboutHerHouse.NodAndThank": "[pg]You think about it and nod, smiling at her and thanking her for the explanation."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToUrtaAboutHerHouse.OldApartmentWondering": "You've been wondering why Urta keeps her old apartment if she has a nicer and bigger house now. It would be much better for her to put the lease money towards something more productive than keeping that apartment..."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToUrtaAboutHerHouse.OrTwoWord": "or two "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TalkToUrtaAboutHerHouse.UpkeepExpenseQuestion": "[pg]You question her about the expenses of maintaining that place, though. Won't she have financial problems?"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TitWorshipAndStroke.GrabsShaftGently": "You smile mischievously around Urta's breast and eagerly grab her shaft with a hand, careful not to hurt her, but roughly enough for her to feel what you just did. Urta lets out a surprised groan. [say: Lover? What are you...?] She moans again as your fingers shift on her distended dick."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TitWorshipAndStroke.RedoublesMilking": "[pg]You blink at her, then get back to the task at hand, redoubling your efforts at draining her of her milk."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TitWorshipAndStroke.StrokesAndTeasesSheath": "[pg]You begin stroking her shaft with all your might, teasing her sheath and pinching her flared tip. She growls and moans, bucking her hips instinctively into your teasing hands. [say: Y-you're gonna get very messy if... ah!] She whimpers and twists at your latest teasing gesture. Before you can contemplate stopping, she lets out a cry of ecstasy as her cock throbs, trembles and then erupts, gushing vixen-cum all over your [chest]. You smile to yourself, giving her cock a couple more strokes to make sure she's drained."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.TitWorshipAndStroke.SwishesTailAmused": "[pg][say: Now look at you... but that was still kind of fun.] Urta says, swishing her tail gently across the bed. [say: Of course, seeing as how you didn't want a little cum cocktail, maybe you should finish drinking your milk, hmm?]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.AdmitPrettyBig": "[pg]Yeah... you're pretty big, you admit. [say: You really should come to Tel'Adre, you know, [name]. I don't know any doctors who'll make house calls all the way out here, not in the state the world is in.] Urta tells you, blatant worry in her eyes."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.AskLetUrtaHelp": "[pg]Do you let Urta <i>help</i> you?"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.AskSeeingHerMore": "[pg]You can't resist but ask if this means you'll be seeing her more frequently? [say: Yes, it does... now, if you'll excuse me...] the vixen replies, ducking into a nearby alley, her skirt blatantly tented by her erection. You let her go handle her problem and go about your own business.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.BabblesTailWagging": "[sayend] She babbles happily, tail wagging so enthusiastically you wonder if it's going to fall off."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.BabyKickingMention": "[pg]You smile at her compliment and tell her that the baby's finally kicking now, asking her if she wants to feel it..."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.BellySmallBump": "[pg]<b>You notice your belly has developed into a small bump. Now you have zero doubts; you're pregnant with Urta's child. You smile to yourself and decide to pay the vixen a visit.</b>"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.EagerBellyPatting": "[pg]Urta smiles and eagerly starts patting and rubbing your belly, gleefully running her fingers over its taut skin, feeling every inch of the gravid swell. [say: Have you felt it kick, yet?] she asks, "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.FetchWaterskin": "[pg]You fetch a waterskin to quench your thirst, then sit down on the outskirts of the camp to get some rest. [say: Hey there, beautiful.] A familiar voice echoes from behind you as Urta emerges from the wilderness. She walks right up to you and reaches around to pat your distended belly. [say: And how's the baby treating you, sexy? You carry that bump well, you know?]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.GoingToBeParents": " Oh, [name], we really are going to be parents..."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.GreetAtCampEdge": "[pg]You go to the edge of the camp to greet Urta. She smiles when she sees you, looking at your expanding belly with pride, and then holds up a woven-cane basket. [say: I thought you might appreciate some fresh supplies - food, drinkables, medicine, that sort of thing - so I brought some along with me on my patrol today.] She explains."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.JealousCarryingYou": "sounding somewhat jealous that it's you carrying and not her."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.LayDownForNap": "[pg]You lay down on your {0} to take a short nap, but when you're nearly dozing off, you spot a shadow on the outside of your [cabin]. Recognizing its vulpine form, you greet Urta as she approaches."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.NauseatedEarlySign": "[pg]<b>You're feeling a bit nauseated. Your mind floats to Urta and you wonder if maybe this means her seed took...</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.NodButDecline": "[pg]You nod, considering her words. But ultimately you don't think you need to go there right away. If you start feeling like you're going to go into labor, then you'll go to Tel'Adre. Urta really doesn't look convinced, but sighs and nods. [say: All right, [name], I know I can't make you change your mind. Just... please try to be careful, all right? You're at your most delicate state, you know?] She doesn't give you time to answer, instead enveloping you in a gently possessive hug. You hug her back and promise to be careful."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.PastGatesSpotUrta": "[pg]Once you're past Tel'Adre's gates you ask around and finally spot Urta walking down a street. She sees you approaching her and smiles, giving you a friendly wave. [say: [name]! What brings you here?] You greet her with a short kiss, not able to contain your smile of happiness. [say: You're affectionate today; what's up? Something good happen?] Urta laughs, happy to see someone who is so happy to see her."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.PatHeadAndSmile": "[pg]You pat her head and smile at her. She looks cute when she's all excited like that. Urta flattens her ears, shuts her eyes and leans into the stroking of your hand, reminding you of the dogs back in the village. [say: Mmm... it feels so good to be here, holding the two of you like this... there's nothing that makes me happier...] She mumbles."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.RubBellyOfferHand": "[pg]You gently rub your protruding belly, then offer her a helping hand. She accepts it, and then gives you a last gentle cuddle. [say: All right, I better get back to scouting; don't do anything I wouldn't do, okay, lover? Or anyone I wouldn't do, either.] She laughs. You give her a quick farewell kiss then send the happy vixen on her way.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.ShakeHeadConsidering": " You shake your head, but considering how far you are into the pregnancy, it shouldn't take long... if Urta keeps visiting, you're pretty sure it'll be kicking the next time she comes around."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.SighHopeSoon": "[pg]You sigh. You hope this baby will be born soon, your back is starting to ache after carrying the little guy everywhere. [say: Hello, lover... oh, why the long face?] Urta asks. You're not surprised that she's here, now. You explain to her about how tired you've been feeling lately, since you got this big. Urta pats your shoulder, looking sympathetic. [say: Really, you should take a break, lover. I'm on an extended patrol right now, so you and I could stay here and rest together for the day - I'll handle the foraging and defending and stuff for you.] She offers."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.SitNearCabin": "[pg]You sit down near your [cabin] to get some rest. You're getting pretty heavy... and lugging this little guy around is starting to affect your performance while adventuring. You decide to sit back and enjoy the cool breeze on this sunny day, when you spot the visage of a familiar vixen in the distance."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.SmugTummyCaress": "sounding a little smug as she caresses her own gravid tummy."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.SquealAndGlomp": "[pg]Urta squeals in glee and immediately glomps onto your bloated belly, rubbing her hands and her cheek excitedly across its [skinfurscales] surface in hopes of feeling her child moving around inside you. You groan at Urta's tight hug, she throws you slightly off-balance, but you manage to remain steady. From inside you, you feel the baby shifting in your increasingly tight womb, and Urta looks up at you in shock, glee dancing in her eyes. [saystart]I felt it! It's moving in there!"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.StrikePoseBelly": "[pg]You strike a small pose, sticking your belly, letting her connect the dots. She giggles, points hesitantly at it, then lets out a cheer and hugs you tightly when you confirm that, yes, you are pregnant, and she's the father. [say: Oh, [name], you make me so happy... what did I ever do to deserve you in my life?] You hug her back, kissing her affectionately, which provokes a rather inappropriate reaction, considering your currently public location. [say: Eh-heh... maybe we should move somewhere more private?] Urta grins sheepishly. [say: And I'll have to start getting myself some more external patrols; I can't just leave the mother of my child alone out there in the wilderness, now can I?] She notes."
