  "Scenes.Urtapregs.VisitKidsFirstTime.BargainRemark": "[pg][say: So, what do you think of it, [name]? I thought it was quite a bargain, especially considering the price I paid for it... I'm just glad the Council gave me that bonus to my pay as a reward, or I'm not sure I could have afforded it.] She notes, clearly hoping you'll approve of the new house."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.VisitKidsFirstTime.CasualReplyWealthWonder": "[pg][say: Yep.] She replies casually. You wonder just how rich Urta really is... [say: Now, come on, more to see upstairs.] She smiles, tugging your arm insistently as she strives to lead you up the stairs, eventually making you go along. First, she shows you an empty room, [say: I haven't decided what we'll do with this one yet; could be a study, maybe? But this... ah, this here is my room,] she notes, proudly opening the door to a room dominated by a comfortable bed - and with subtle signs of multiple drains across the floor. [say: And it'll be your room, too, as soon as you finish moving in,] she notes happily."
