  "Scenes.Urtapregs.VisitKidsFirstTime.PassionateKissReturn": "[pg]You kiss her back, quickly turning the kiss more passionate. With a pleased moan, she wraps you in her arms, pulling you close as she hungrily kisses you; you have a feeling that no matter how often you do this, she'll never be any less surprised by it - or eager to bask in it. You break the kiss, panting and more than a little aroused, something that does not go unnoticed by the vixen. [say: You little tease... you look like you'd like to give my new bed a try, don't you?] she giggles, and pinches your cheek. [say: Sorry, I have things to do now... here; make sure you don't lose this - it's your copy of the key to the locks on this house,] she says, handing you a small iron key."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.VisitKidsFirstTime.PocketKeyDepart": "[pg]You pocket the key and go about your business."
