  "Scenes.Urtapregs.VisitTheHouse.NoseTwitchScentQuery": "[pg]She twitches her nose. [say: You smell like a human, but you aren't a human...?] You figure it can't hurt and explain you were human before coming to Mareth, but gave up your humanity with the magical items that abound in this land. She nods her head in realization."
