  "Scenes.Urtapregs.WeirdUrtaCravingsConclusion.DrawHerIntoKiss": "[pg]You smile at her then draw her into another kiss, planting your lips to hers and invading her mouth with your "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.WeirdUrtaCravingsConclusion.FeelSomeoneGroping": "You have the distinct feeling that someone is groping you and something is wiggling inside your mouth... actually it feels like someone is lapping you inside your mouth. You open your eyes to gaze at Urta's green eyes, as she continues kissing you. She holds your [face] with both hands, closing her eyes as she deepens the kiss, then slowly lets go, opening her eyes and smiling. [say: Morning, lover; sleep well?] She laughs."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.WeirdUrtaCravingsConclusion.ForkedTongue": "forked "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.WeirdUrtaCravingsConclusion.GazeQuestioningly": " You gaze at her questioningly. [say: I woke up before you and went and... shall we say cleaned myself up a little,] she replies, flicking her ears in the direction of the shower."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.WeirdUrtaCravingsConclusion.LackingExtraPaunch": "lacking the extra bit of paunch you gave her earlier."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.WeirdUrtaCravingsConclusion.NoticeSheIsClean": "[pg]You nod, then notice that she's "
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.WeirdUrtaCravingsConclusion.TakingCueDepart": "[pg]Taking that as your cue, you do likewise, and the two of you go your separate ways after locking the apartment up behind you."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.WeirdUrtaCravingsConclusion.TongueGaspsSurprise": "tongue. She {0}s in surprise, then moans as she eagerly sinks into your embrace, kissing you back with equal passion. She suddenly breaks it, looking apologetic. [say: Sorry, [name], but if we keep that up, I'll be wanting another round, and I have things to do.] She pats your face apologetically and shifts herself, somewhat clumsily, out of the bed, gathering her clothes and starting to dress herself."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.YesUrtaHouseSex.AlmostStripRightThere": " Sometimes you almost give up on waiting to get to her apartment and instead strip and do her right then and there... but it wouldn't bode well for the Watch captain to get a fine for public indecency."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.YesUrtaHouseSex.KeyFromWallet": "[pg]Fishing out a key from her wallet, Urta unhooks herself from your arm to open the door and then saunters inside, flirtatiously flicking her tail at you as she goes. You eagerly follow after her."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.YesUrtaHouseSex.MakeoutEveryTurn": "[pg]The trip is difficult; Urta seems intent on making out at every turn."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.YesUrtaHouseSex.ParagraphBreak": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.YesUrtaHouseSex.PayTabBackDoor": "[pg]You rush to pay the tab and exit out the back door, looking around to meet Urta. Urta grins playfully from her position, leaning against the very wall where you first discovered her dual-gendered nature and took the first path to becoming lovers. [say: Looks like somebody's as eager as I am,] she giggles, precum already staining her dress. She then offers you her arm like a courtly gallant. [say: Shall we go?] You take her arm and follow her towards her apartment."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.YesUrtaHouseSex.PromisingSmilePayment": "[pg]Urta gives you a smile that promises she's going to enjoy this, fishing out the payment for her tab and passing it to you, stealing a kiss as she does. She then gets up from her seat; unlike her old self, however, she doesn't make a mad dash for the back door. Instead, the newly self-confident herm actively struts her way out, letting her tent bulge before her and wiggling her hips in a feminine manner as she goes, making no secret of the fact she's waiting for you."
  "Scenes.Urtapregs.YesUrtaHouseSex.SeductiveSmileBrow": "You smile seductively at her and raise a brow."
